# Planar clang-format configuration — adopted from tabula (D16), the
# stack's newest C++ tree, whose config targets the latest-LLVM dialect.
# Use the pinned LLVM's clang-format (docs/toolchain-parity.md), not
# whichever binary PATH finds first — this is a versioned dialect and two
# LLVM releases can disagree about the same file under the same config.
---
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 130
PointerAlignment: Left
ReferenceAlignment: Left
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Never
AlignConsecutiveAssignments: Consecutive
AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: Consecutive
AlignConsecutiveMacros: Consecutive
ReflowComments: true
CommentPragmas: '^ IWYU pragma:|^!|^:|^@(file|brief|param|return|tparam|note|see|throws|pre|post)'
Standard: Latest
...
